{"file": "惊悚游戏：我只是有亿点点钱-第89集.mp4", "ep": 89, "duration": 59.4, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 3.62, "text": "一把火就想燒死我"}, {"start": 4.02, "end": 5.18, "text": "圓魂們"}, {"start": 5.82, "end": 9.26, "text": "我用血和人命交貫了你們二十年"}, {"start": 9.42, "end": 10.5, "text": "現在"}, {"start": 10.9, "end": 13.02, "text": "蘇醒吧"}, {"start": 20.51, "end": 21.07, "text": "糟了"}, {"start": 21.66, "end": 22.98, "text": "我是被漸漸壓下去了"}, {"start": 23.66, "end": 24.42, "text": "老大"}, {"start": 24.62, "end": 25.66, "text": "我們來了"}, {"start": 25.66, "end": 26.62, "text": "要做什麼"}, {"start": 26.62, "end": 27.86, "text": "你只管說"}, {"start": 27.86, "end": 28.98, "text": "今天我不殺你"}, {"start": 29.58, "end": 30.9, "text": "但你欠我一個忙"}, {"start": 31.18, "end": 31.62, "text": "好"}, {"start": 31.98, "end": 32.46, "text": "好"}, {"start": 32.58, "end": 34.18, "text": "燒了這座風人院"}, {"start": 34.85, "end": 35.81, "text": "這一百萬"}, {"start": 36.38, "end": 37.38, "text": "就歸你了"}, {"start": 38.38, "end": 39.14, "text": "得嘞"}, {"start": 39.38, "end": 41.62, "text": "殺人放火我們最專業了"}, {"start": 41.62, "end": 43.98, "text": "保證燒的這一點紮都不剩"}, {"start": 44.22, "end": 45.22, "text": "小的們"}, {"start": 45.88, "end": 46.76, "text": "上啊"}, {"start": 47.88, "end": 57.55, "text": "都燒起來了"}]}